<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>BlackMamba0205</Major>
    <Description>THOMPSON no HOLO BEST %90-95 For low sens

(FOV ) : 90

 ( 1920 x 1080 )

Sensivity ( 0.4 )

This macro is perfect to use without accessory on your Thompson
</Description>
    <Comment></Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>1</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>LeftDown 1
Delay 20 ms
MoveR 0 10
Delay 20 ms
MoveR 0 10
Delay 20 ms
LeftUp 1
Delay 1 ms</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Rust</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
